OL,3,AAI app ads promoting 'objectification
OL,4,Aof women' banned by watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of social media adverts for AI
OL,7,Fapps have been banned by a UK watchdog
OL,8,Ffor promoting "the creation of sexually
OL,9,Fexplicit content and objectification of
OL,10,Fwomen".
OL,12,FThe Advertising Standards Authority
OL,13,F(ASA) said five ads uploaded to Meta
OL,14,Fplatforms for AI companion and video
OL,15,Fgenerating apps had objectified and
OL,16,Fsexualised women, including through
OL,17,Fharmful gender stereotypes.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
